abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for the Water Consumption Impact (WCI) index
  and companion Peak Delivery Load Ratio (PDLR), including audited inputs,
  conditional ten-case results, one-at-a-time sensitivity checks, synthetic
  boundary and failure-mode tests, case-specific parameter-range uncertainty
  checks, validation checks, and figure generation.
